@ProductCatalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5185

GET {{ProductCatalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{ProductCatalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/
Content-Type: application/json
